OL,3,GNEWSAStrong winds could damage trees
OL,4,Aand disrupt travel
OL,5,
OL,6,FForecasters have warned that severe
OL,7,Fweather this week could bring tree
OL,8,Fbranches down and disrupt travel.
OL,10,FJersey Met has forecast that winds
OL,11,Fcould reach severe gale force 9 by
OL,12,FFriday morning, with gusts to 90mph
OL,13,F(113km/h).
OL,15,FSenior forecaster Matt Winter said
OL,16,Fthings could still change and
OL,17,Fforecasters were looking through
OL,18,Fseveral weather models to see what was
OL,19,Fmost likely to happen.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
