OL,3,GNEWSAStrong winds could damage trees
OL,4,Aand disrupt travel
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "At the moment, we are
OL,7,Fexpecting to see gale perhaps severe
OL,8,Fgale-force winds... some of the model
OL,9,Fdata has been suggesting we could see
OL,10,Fsomething a little bit stronger than
OL,11,Fthat."
